  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Where are we today?",
      "start": 0.119,
      "end": 0.979
    },
    {
      "text": "Our recipe is a curriculum of five adapters, trained one after another and the order we train them in is itself a real design decision.",
      "start": 2.72,
      "end": 10.739
    },
    {
      "text": "We call it the training curriculum.",
      "start": 11.34,
      "end": 12.859
    },
    {
      "text": "First we teach the model to draw a floor plan at all.",
      "start": 13.939,
      "end": 16.319
    },
    {
      "text": "Then to draw a good one, by giving it feedback on architectural quality.",
      "start": 16.959,
      "end": 20.579
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we move up a level, to a whole floor and because the quality lessons are already baked in, we don't just get floors, we get GOOD floors.",
      "start": 21.359,
      "end": 29.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Then whole buildings.",
      "start": 29.979,
      "end": 31.039
    },
    {
      "text": "And finally, we push toward structural efficiency.",
      "start": 31.34,
      "end": 33.639
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, some of that order is forced on you you obviously can't optimize a building's structure before the model can even design a building.",
      "start": 34.659,
      "end": 40.939
    },
    {
      "text": "But a lot of it is wide open, and honestly we've barely explored it.",
      "start": 41.54,
      "end": 45.119
    },
    {
      "text": "We chose to teach quality early, on a single apartment, on a hunch that it's easier to learn there than across a whole building and it paid off: that feedback step pushed the share of usable apartment layouts from fifty-one up to EIGHTY percent.",
      "start": 46.2,
      "end": 61.18
    },
    {
      "text": "So where does that leave us?",
      "start": 61.239,
      "end": 62.379
    },
    {
      "text": "The first four are trained and working apartment, quality, floor, building.",
      "start": 63.059,
      "end": 67.479
    },
    {
      "text": "The fifth is the one we're still training: taking that same feedback loop and pointing it at the whole building, this time for structural efficiency.",
      "start": 68.04,
      "end": 75.239
    },
    {
      "text": "And all of this the adapters themselves and the curriculum that trains them is Luyang Zhang's piece of the project.",
      "start": 76.059,
      "end": 82.299
    }
  ]
}